Third-party notices
===================

The files syntaxes/c.tmLanguage.json and syntaxes/cpp.tmLanguage.json are taken
unchanged from https://github.com/microsoft/vscode (extensions/cpp, commit
9a59550fc841805ebb44cfd5a09b92beed591d15). They are generated from
jeff-hykin/better-c-syntax and jeff-hykin/better-cpp-syntax, which were
originally derived from atom/language-c (itself converted from the TextMate C
bundle). The better-*-syntax projects are licensed as follows:

